{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-08-27 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE PUBLISHES 2020 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT', 'text': "GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / AUGUST 27, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS PUBLISHED ITS 2020 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT. THE 2020 SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT REPORT OUTLINES LINDE'S APPROACH TO ENVIRONMENT, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) PRINCIPLES AND DETAILS HOW THE COMPANY'S CORE VALUES OF SAFETY, INCLUSION, INTEGRITY, ACCOUNTABILITY AND COMMUNITY ARE FIRMLY EMBEDDED WITHIN ITS BUSINESS."}